Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
Set Framerate 60

Hide
Type "make build"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "./lugotui"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Down@35ms 8
Enter
Sleep 600ms

Tab 3
Sleep 200ms
Enter
Sleep 160ms
Enter
Sleep 160ms
Enter
Sleep 250ms

Shift+Tab
Sleep 150ms
Enter
Sleep 160ms
Enter
Sleep 350ms

Shift+Tab
Shift+Tab
Up
Enter
Sleep 400ms

Tab 3
Sleep 250ms
Type "j"
Sleep 220ms
Type " "
Sleep 300ms
Type " "
Sleep 250ms
Type "j"
Sleep 220ms
Enter
Sleep 350ms

Shift+Tab
Shift+Tab
Shift+Tab
Up@35ms 5
Enter
Sleep 400ms

Tab 2
Sleep 150ms
Ctrl+A
Backspace
Type "Reactive model binding"
Sleep 350ms
Enter
Sleep 350ms

Ctrl+P
Sleep 350ms
Type "scratch"
Sleep 250ms
Sleep 350ms

Type " Zero CGo · Retained 60 FPS"
Sleep 1.8s

Ctrl+Q
Sleep 400ms

Hide
Type "mv internal/assets/demo.lua.bak internal/assets/demo.lua 2>/dev/null; rm -f lugotui"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
